                                                "example_id": "713ab807-0b83-469f-89b6-c84db1a238cc",
                                                "sense_id": "742231fe-2312-3eea-a2b8-e994307ce0ae",
                                                "text": "Buckingham might have mimicked the pedantry of his manners, and Coventry have complained of his interminable dawdlings and delays."
